in and</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW215301910 BCX4\">water purification.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW215301910 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\"></span>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW215301910 BCX4\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW215301910 BCX4\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW215301910 BCX4\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW215301910 BCX4\">The program supports research in process design and optimization that uses</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW215301910 BCX4\">tools such as</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW215301910 BCX4\">artificial intelligence, machine learning, and uncertainty quantification. CPS research also explores quantum information science and engineering</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW215301910 BCX4\">;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW215301910 BCX4\">quantum simulation and sensing</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW215301910 BCX4\">, for example, may</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW215301910 BCX4\">accelerate the discovery of materials and improve process models.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW215301910 BCX4\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\"></span>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW215301910 BCX4\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW215301910 BCX4\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW215301910 BCX4\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Partnerships:</span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW215301910 BCX4\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">To speed discovery and innovation, NSF partners with federal agencies, industry, international groups, and others. Current opportunities are at</span><a class=\"Hyperlink SCXW215301910 BCX4\" href=\"https://nsf.gov/eng/partnerships\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"TextRun Underlined SCXW215301910 BCX4\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><